  "description": "This library upgrade the existing WebApplicationBuilder and allows you to add the desired functionality to the application in just a couple of lines. This library using reflection and custom attributes to connect application modules, thereby encapsulating most of the code that is needed to initialize these modules in the microservice.\n\nThe most up-to-date documentation on GitHub: https://github.com/qpashkaaa/Asp-Net-Core-Microservice-Initializer.",
